22=v0.6
23=+ Extended domain bypass .ru + .рф
24=+ Replace `sing-box` with `naive + xray`
25=+ HTTPS mode: Improved responsiveness with HTTP/2
26=+ Self-contained RPM & DEB packages
27=
28=**Note:** The configurator has been completely redesigned. The reason is that sing-box doesn't guarantee [quic=false](https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/issues/4181) switching, which can cause the connection to be blocked. This behavior is only observed on desktops. You need to recreate your connection to the server.
29=
